<title>UK: London International fy profits rise.</title>
<headline>London International fy profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.50		   vs 5.76</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.8		    vs 2.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     29.5		   vs 26.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   339.2		  vs 309.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The results included net exceptional charges of 6.1 million stg. Analysts' forecasts were for pre-tax profit before exceptional items of between 36.0 and 38.2 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - London International Group Plc -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
